# Files that must never leave this machine in a published bundle.
#
# build.py strips a specific workspace's names, paths and ids out of the
# upstream engine, so its rename map *is* a list of those names. Publishing the
# build script would publish exactly what the build script exists to remove.
# engram_extras.py is its companion and is build-time only.
#
# Nothing here is needed to run Engram. install.sh does not copy either file.
build.py
engine/engram_extras.py

# Generated handoff artifacts. Rebuild with: python3 build.py --emit-markers
*.patch

# CI scaffolding for this repo, not for an installed workspace.
ci/
